OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fthis evening with the odd shower
OL,7,Feasing, leaving a dry but muggy start
OL,8,Fto the night. Further rain and
OL,9,Fthunderstorms are likely to reach the
OL,10,Fsouth by dawn, drier in the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FHeavy rain and thunderstorms
OL,13,Fwill continue moving north through the
OL,14,Fday, with a risk of localised
OL,15,Fflooding. Some drier, brighter
OL,16,Fconditions will spread into the south
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
