OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Funsettled through Friday and the
OL,7,Fweekend, with further rain and
OL,8,Fshowers, heavy and perhaps thundery at
OL,9,Ftimes. Some drier and brighter spells
OL,10,Falso developing. Temperatures near
OL,11,Faverage.
